---
// src/pages/terms-and-conditions.astro
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms & Conditions | Free Seller Profit Calculator"
  description="Terms and conditions of use for freesellerprofitcalculator.in — legal terms, calculation disclaimers, and intellectual property guidelines."
  canonicalPath="/terms-and-conditions/"
>
  <main class="min-h-screen bg-white">
    <!-- Hero Banner -->
    <section class="border-b border-neutral-200 bg-neutral-50/50 py-10 sm:py-14">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
          <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-neutral-100 text-neutral-700 border border-neutral-200">
            Legal &bull; Updated 2026
          </span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-neutral-900">
          Terms &amp; Conditions
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-neutral-500">
          Last Revised: January 1, 2026 &bull; Governed under the laws of the Republic of India
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Terms Content -->
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-10 sm:py-14 space-y-10 text-neutral-700 leading-relaxed text-sm">
      
      <!-- Critical Financial Disclaimer Box -->
      <div class="p-4 sm:p-5 rounded-2xl bg-amber-50/60 border border-amber-200 text-xs sm:text-sm text-amber-950">
        <div class="font-bold mb-1 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-amber-600"></span>
          Important Financial &amp; Tax Disclaimer
        </div>
        <p class="text-neutral-700 leading-relaxed">
          Seller Profit Calculator provides mathematical estimations based on publicly published 2026 rate cards for Amazon India, Flipkart, Meesho, and third-party logistics. <strong>Our calculators do NOT constitute formal tax advice, legal counsel, or guaranteed bank disbursements.</strong> Marketplace fee slabs, fuel surcharges, weight audits, and GST rules change regularly. Sellers must cross-reference their official seller portal settlement reports and consult a Chartered Accountant (CA) for statutory compliance.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Section 1 -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-neutral-900 tracking-tight">
          1. Acceptance of Terms
        </h2>
        <p>
          By accessing or using <strong>freesellerprofitcalculator.in</strong> (the "Service"), you agree to be bound by these Terms and Conditions ("Terms"). If you do not agree to all of these Terms, you may not access or use the Service.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 2 -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-neutral-900 tracking-tight">
          2. Nature of the Service
        </h2>
        <p>
          The Service is a free, web-based suite of mathematical calculation tools designed to help online sellers, merchants, and D2C brands model:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 text-neutral-600">
          <li>Platform referral fees, fixed closing fees, and pickup handling charges.</li>
          <li>Logistics expenses, dead weight vs volumetric weight billing, and 3PL courier rates.</li>
          <li>Return to Origin (RTO) cash burn on Cash-on-Delivery (COD) shipments.</li>
          <li>18% GST deductions on marketplace service fees and Input Tax Credit (ITC) reconciliation.</li>
          <li>E-commerce advertising metrics such as ROAS, ACOS, TACOS, and customer acquisition costs.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 3 -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-neutral-900 tracking-tight">
          3. Accuracy of Calculations &amp; Rate Cards
        </h2>
        <p>
          While we make reasonable efforts to reflect the latest fee slabs and GST guidelines applicable in India:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 text-neutral-600">
          <li>Marketplaces (including Amazon Seller Central, Flipkart Seller Hub, Meesho Supplier Panel, Myntra Partner Portal, Blinkit, and Zepto) alter category commission structures, promo incentives, and weight slabs at their sole discretion without notice.</li>
          <li>Courier aggregators dynamically apply regional fuel surcharges, emergency surcharges, and volumetric weight corrections.</li>
          <li>We make no warranties, express or implied, regarding the absolute precision or completeness of any calculation. You assume sole responsibility for all product pricing decisions and inventory purchase orders.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 4 -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-neutral-900 tracking-tight">
          4. Intellectual Property
        </h2>
        <p>
          The software code, interface design, algorithms, visual styles, custom graphics, and written content comprising the Service are the intellectual property of Seller Profit Calculator and are protected by applicable copyright and trademark laws.
        </p>
        <p>
          All third-party trademarks, service marks, platform names, and logos (such as "Amazon," "Flipkart," "Meesho," "Myntra," "Snapdeal," "Blinkit," and "Zepto") referenced on this website are the property of their respective owners. Their use on this website is solely for identification and educational reference under nominative fair use doctrine. We are not endorsed by, directly affiliated with, or sponsored by any of these entities.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 5 -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-neutral-900 tracking-tight">
          5. Permitted &amp; Prohibited Use
        </h2>
        <p>
          You are granted a personal, non-exclusive, non-transferable license to use the calculators for your private or commercial seller business operations. You agree NOT to:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 text-neutral-600">
          <li>Engage in unauthorized automated scraping, mass data harvesting, or programmatic extraction without prior written consent.</li>
          <li>Attempt to reverse-engineer, decompile, or bypass security features of the website.</li>
          <li>Launch denial-of-service (DDoS) attacks or interfere with server performance.</li>
          <li>Frame or mirror any part of the site without proper attribution.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 6 -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-neutral-900 tracking-tight">
          6. Limitation of Liability
        </h2>
        <p>
          To the maximum extent permitted by applicable Indian law, Seller Profit Calculator, its developers, operators, and affiliates shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, consequential, special, or punitive damages — including but not limited to loss of profits, unexpected marketplace settlement debits, inventory losses, tax penalties, or business interruption — arising out of or related to your use of or inability to use the Service.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 7 -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-neutral-900 tracking-tight">
          7. Governing Law and Jurisdiction
        </h2>
        <p>
          These Terms shall be governed by and construed in accordance with the substantive laws of the <strong>Republic of India</strong>. Any dispute, claim, or controversy arising out of or relating to these Terms or the breach thereof shall be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the competent courts situated in <strong>New Delhi or Bengaluru, India</strong>.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 8 -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-neutral-900 tracking-tight">
          8. Amendments to Terms
        </h2>
        <p>
          We reserve the right to revise or amend these Terms at any time by updating this page with a revised date. Continued use of the website following any changes constitutes your binding acceptance of the modified Terms.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 9 -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-neutral-900 tracking-tight">
          9. Contact Us
        </h2>
        <p>
          If you have questions regarding these Terms &amp; Conditions, please contact us at:
        </p>
        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 bg-neutral-50 text-xs space-y-1 font-mono">
          <div><strong>Email:</strong> legal@freesellerprofitcalculator.in</div>
          <div><strong>General Support:</strong> support@freesellerprofitcalculator.in</div>
        </div>
      </section>

    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
